    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_first_01",
      "hash64": "42D22C0900D222B6",
      "text": "Mon nom est Okuba. À votre service.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "F68097F619D1735F",
      "text": "Tiens, mais je te reconnais.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "F68096F619D171AC",
      "text": "Je te trouve bien entreprenant[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e\\nde me forcer à me déplacer jusqu’ici.\\c\\nTu n’essaierais pas d’imiter une certaine\\nprésidente de la Ligue, à tout hasard ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 159,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "F68099F619D176C5",
      "text": "Ceci étant dit, je n’ai rien contre les voyages\\nd’affaires... J’avoue même en être friand.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "F68098F619D17512",
      "text": "Je n’oublie pas le travail, mais puisque\\nje suis ici, je m’autorise quelques activités\\r\\nextraprofessionnelles.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 112,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "F68093F619D16C93",
      "text": "Je goûterais bien à la cuisine d’Unys...\\c\\nJ’ai entendu parler des sandwichs aux Baies\\net de la Glace Volute. Que me conseilles-tu ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "508901898B20563B",
      "text": "Les sandwichs aux Baies !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "508902898B2057EE",
      "text": "La Glace Volute !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "F68092F619D16AE0",
      "text": "Je vois.\\nTu aimes donc toujours autant les sandwichs.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "ADE43A2DDED7FAE6",
      "text": "Je vois. Tu préfères donc la glace.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_06",
      "hash64": "F68095F619D16FF9",
      "text": "J’en prends note...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp01_07",
      "hash64": "F68094F619D16E46",
      "text": "Quand notre petit entretien sera terminé,\\nj’irai dépenser ma prime dans un déjeuner.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "CA798DEFB8675DB0",
      "text": "Oh. C’est toi.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "CA798EEFB8675F63",
      "text": "Je suis allé goûter les sandwichs aux Baies\\ndont tu m’as parlé la dernière fois.\\c\\nLeur saveur unique les distingue de ceux\\nde Paldea, et je les ai trouvés très bons.\\c\\nMon Étouraptor n’a d’ailleurs pas cessé\\nde becqueter le mien... Les Baies semblent\\r\\nlui avoir plu !\\c\\nEn tout cas, nous nous sommes régalés, et...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 253,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 272,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 320,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_01b",
      "hash64": "73ECE25657A66EB3",
      "text": "Je suis allé goûter la Glace Volute\\ndont tu m’as parlé la dernière fois.\\c\\nSa crème onctueuse et sa saveur exquise lui\\ndonnent un goût de revenez-y. C’était un délice.\\c\\nÀ Paldea, les Glaces au sel de Selutin de chez\\nSucré Glacé occupent une place de choix parmi\\r\\nles desserts de la région, et je dois dire que\\r\\nla Glace Volute s’en rapproche grandement\\r\\nde par la qualité de ses ingrédients. On sent\\r\\nqu’ils ont été choisis avec soin, et...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 264,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 314,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 359,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 408,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 451,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "CA798FEFB8676116",
      "text": "... Pardon. Je me suis légèrement emporté.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "CA7990EFB86762C9",
      "text": "Je pense que ce sont les découvertes culinaires\\nqui donnent toute leur saveur aux voyages, qu’ils\\r\\nsoient d’affaires ou non, et cela me rend bavard.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "CA7991EFB867647C",
      "text": "Même si, quelque part, rien ne vaut un bon plat\\nmaison au goût standard mais familier.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "F3B1A3E46DEA10C1",
      "text": "Dis-moi... As-tu déjà mangé à la cafétéria\\nde l’Institut Myrtille ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "F3B1A2E46DEA0F0E",
      "text": "Les plats y sont délicieux, n’est-ce pas ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_01b",
      "hash64": "00E73626C4B83484",
      "text": "Ah bon ? Pourtant, les plats y sont délicieux.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F3B1A1E46DEA0D5B",
      "text": "Ils sont riches et semblent donc plutôt pensés\\npour un public jeune, mais les portions\\r\\ngénéreuses ont retenu mon attention.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F3B1A0E46DEA0BA8",
      "text": "Je pense en particulier aux Frites de l’institut.\\c\\nUne seule portion suffirait à nourrir toute\\nla compta.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F3B1A7E46DEA178D",
      "text": "Si tu ne les as pas encore goûtées, je t’encourage\\nà le faire.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "23FC6E8CF2B8BFC3",
      "text": "Je ne m’attendais pas à ce que tu manifestes\\nle moindre intérêt pour mes histoires banales...[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "23FC6D8CF2B8BE10",
      "text": "Tu es quelqu’un d’étrange.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "23FC708CF2B8C329",
      "text": "Mais puisque nous sommes là, accepterais-tu\\nd’échanger un Pokémon avec moi ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "23FC6F8CF2B8C176",
      "text": "Je te propose un Deusolourdo. J’accepterai\\nn’importe quel Pokémon en échange.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "23FC728CF2B8C68F",
      "text": "Ton [VAR 0x0101(0001)] est... intéressant.\\nJ’imagine qu’il a du potentiel.\\c\\nMerci d’avoir accepté cet échange.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_trade_02_00",
      "hash64": "20A14487C9DCF6B4",
      "text": "Tu vas donc échanger ton [VAR 0x0101(0001)]\\ncontre mon Deusolourdo. Cela te convient ?[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
