        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_01",
      "hash64": "36566BE3B8700B7F",
      "text": "J’espère que notre Cheffe ne te surcharge\\npas de travail.\\c\\nN’hésite pas à lui dire non, sinon, tu finiras\\nécrasé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e par la hiérarchie.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 57,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 139,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "36566CE3B8700D32",
      "text": "C’était une très mauvaise idée de me mettre\\njuste avant Hassa, dans l’examen du Conseil 4.\\c\\nSi Cayenn ou Popi venaient après moi,\\nje n’aurais pas à crier pour me faire entendre.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 179,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0015"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_gym_nomal_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "36566DE3B8700EE5",
      "text": "Ton [VAR 0x0101(0001)] se porte bien.\\nEt je ne pense pas que ce soit une Façade.[VAR 0x0114(0015)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
